# NOTICE

Lumo Browser is an independently maintained set of patches, scripts and tooling
that is applied to an unmodified upstream **Chromium** source tree. Chromium
itself is **not** vendored in this repository.

## Chromium

- Project: https://www.chromium.org/
- Source: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src
- License: BSD-3-Clause (`chromium/src/LICENSE`)

Every file under `patches/` is a diff **against Chromium source files**. As a
derivative work, the patched hunks remain under Chromium's BSD-3-Clause license
and carry Chromium's copyright notices; the diff metadata and the surrounding
explanation are MIT (see `LICENSE`). When applying a patch, the resulting file
keeps Chromium's header and license.

