## Reference projects (read, not copied)

- **Titanium** (GPL-2.0): used only as a *problem list* / behavioural baseline.
  No GPL code is copied into this repository. See `docs/02-baseline-titanium.md`.
- **lumo** and **lumo-userscript-manager** are separate sibling repositories
  used as first-class test extensions; they are not part of this repository and
  are not redistributed here.

## Third-party assets

- Launch icon artwork (`scripts/chromium/branding/*.svg`) is original work.
- Probe extension icons (`tools/probe-extension/icons/*.png`) are generated from
  the same artwork.
- `tools/mock-openai.py` implements the OpenAI-compatible wire format for local
  testing only; it is not affiliated with OpenAI.
